flowchart TB
    A[Your device\nsplits the message into packets] --> B[Radio waves\nWi-Fi or cell tower]
    B --> C[Router and modem\nhome network gateway]
    C --> D[ISP network\nprovider chooses the route]
    D --> E[Regional hubs\ndata centers exchange traffic]
    E --> F[Submarine cables\nlight pulses in glass fiber]
    F --> G[Destination\npackets reassembled in order]
